---
import { getEntry } from 'astro:content'
import { Box, Container, Database, HardDrive, Server, Timer } from 'lucide-react'

import CopyIcon from './CopyIcon.astro'

const guide = await getEntry('docs', 'guide/deployment')
---

<section class="l-section" id="deploy">
  <div class="l-wrap">
    <div class="l-head l-reveal">
      <span class="l-eyebrow">Deploy</span>
      <h2>Runs where <span class="l-grad">you do.</span></h2>
      <p>
        One image for every role: <code>holtkeeper serve --role web|worker|scheduler</code>. Start with a single
        container and SQLite; add Postgres and S3 when more than one process shares the work.
      </p>
      {guide && <a class="more" href="/guide/deployment/">Read the deployment guide →</a>}
    </div>

    <div class="cards">
      <article class="l-card card l-reveal">
        <header>
          <span class="tag"><Container size={14} /> Docker Compose</span>
          <h3>Web, workers, Postgres and MinIO</h3>
        </header>
        <div class="topo">
          <div class="node main">
            <Server size={15} />
            <span><b>web</b><i>API · panel · webhooks · scheduler</i></span>
          </div>
          <div class="workers">
            {
              [1, 2, 3].map((n) => (
                <div class="node">
                  <Box size={14} />
                  <span>
                    <b>worker {n}</b>
                    <i>jobs · mise cache</i>
                  </span>
                </div>
              ))
            }
          </div>
          <div class="infra">
            <div class="node dim"><Database size={14} /><span><b>postgres</b></span></div>
            <div class="node dim"><HardDrive size={14} /><span><b>minio</b><i>artifacts</i></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="facts">
          <li>Read-only root filesystem, every capability dropped, <code>no-new-privileges</code></li>
          <li><code>--max-jobs 1</code> gives every job a fresh container</li>
          <li>Single-container mode: SQLite and artifacts in one volume</li>
        </ul>
        <button class="cmd" type="button" data-copy="docker compose -f deploy/docker-compose.yml up -d --scale worker=3">
          <span class="p">$</span> docker compose -f deploy/docker-compose.yml up -d --scale worker=3
          <CopyIcon />
        </button>
      </article>

      <article class="l-card card l-reveal">
        <header>
          <span class="tag"><Timer size={14} /> Kubernetes</span>
          <h3>A Helm chart with one job per pod</h3>
        </header>
        <div class="topo">
          <div class="node main">
            <Server size={15} />
            <span><b>web ×2</b><i>HPA · PDB · leader-elected scheduler</i></span>
          </div>
          <div class="workers pods">
            {
              ['job 4812', 'job 4813', 'job 4814', 'job 4815'].map((n, i) => (
                <div class="node pod" style={`--i:${i}`}>
                  <Box size={14} />
                  <span>
                    <b>{n}</b>
                    <i>--max-jobs 1</i>
                  </span>
                </div>
              ))
            }
          </div>
          <div class="infra">
            <div class="node dim"><Database size={14} /><span><b>Postgres</b></span></div>
            <div class="node dim"><HardDrive size={14} /><span><b>S3</b><i>artifacts</i></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="facts">
          <li>KEDA scales workers on <code>holtkeeper_jobs_queued</code>, or runs a Kubernetes Job per queued job</li>
          <li>SIGTERM drains running jobs, then requeues what is left</li>
          <li>Non-root pods, NetworkPolicy for worker egress, ServiceMonitor for <code>/metrics</code></li>
        </ul>
        <button class="cmd" type="button" data-copy="helm install holtkeeper deploy/helm/holtkeeper">
          <span class="p">$</span> helm install holtkeeper deploy/helm/holtkeeper
          <CopyIcon />
        </button>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .l-head code {
    padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--l-line-2);
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    color: var(--l-text);
    font: 0.86em var(--l-mono);
  }
  .more {
    justify-self: start;
    color: var(--l-amber-ink);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .more:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.4rem;
    padding: 1.75rem;
  }
  header {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    align-items: center;
    color: var(--l-amber-ink);
    font: 500 0.72rem var(--l-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .topo {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    padding: 1.1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--l-line);
    border-radius: 0.9rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(var(--l-line) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0 / 14px 14px,
      var(--l-bg-2);
  }
  .workers,
  .infra {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(7.5rem, 1fr));
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .node {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.65rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--l-line-2);
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    background: var(--l-card);
    color: var(--l-muted);
  }
  .node span {
    display: grid;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .node b {
    color: var(--l-text);
    font: 500 0.76rem var(--l-mono);
  }
  .node i {
    overflow: hidden;
    color: var(--l-dim);
    font: normal 0.66rem var(--l-mono);
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .node.main {
    border-color: var(--l-amber-line);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--l-amber-soft), var(--l-card));
    color: var(--l-amber-ink);
  }
  .node.dim {
    border-style: dashed;
  }
  .pod {
    animation: pod 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * 1.5s);
  }
  @keyframes pod {
    0%,
    100% {
      border-color: var(--l-line-2);
    }
    15%,
    55% {
      border-color: var(--l-teal-line);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px -8px var(--l-teal);
    }
    70% {
      opacity: 0.55;
    }
  }
  .facts {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--l-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .facts li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
  }
  .facts li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.62em;
    left: 0;
    width: 0.4rem;
    height: 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--l-teal);
  }
  .facts code {
    color: var(--l-text);
    font: 0.85em var(--l-mono);
  }
  .cmd {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--t-line);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--t-bg);
    color: var(--t-text);
    font: 0.82rem var(--l-mono);
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .cmd :global(svg) {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: var(--t-dim);
  }
  .cmd[data-copied] :global(svg) {
    color: var(--t-teal);
  }
  .p {
    color: var(--t-amber);
  }
  @media (max-width: 56rem) {
    .cards {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
